imate what the December clearance actually cost the group in margin versus what it earned in volume and cleared inventory."}, {"id": "X-S6", "text": "Check whether higher family_size correlates with higher accessories spend — do bigger households buy more add-ons?"}]}]}$pack$::jsonb
