 size."}]}, {"key": "dash1", "title": "Phase 3a — Dashboard Page 1: Deal Lookup", "tasks": [{"id": "D2", "text": "On the same lookup screen, show customer context: family size, customer type, accessories taken, the face-to-face feedback reason, and any remarks."}, {"id": "D3", "text": "Add a date-range filter on Booking Date and a separate date-range filter on (Scheduled or Actual) Delivery Date, and make sure both can be applied together."}, {"id": "D5", "text": "Make the deal-lookup results table itself filterable/sortable by any visible column, so someone can browse instead of only searching by exact Deal ID."}, {"id": "D1", "text": "Build a search box that takes a Deal ID and returns everything about that one deal on a single screen: salesperson + branch, car (model/variant/tier/fuel/colour/model year), the full price chain (ex-showroom → floor → quoted → discount → final), payment/finance detail, and the delivery timeline (enquiry → booking → scheduled → actual, with the gap called out)."}, {"id": "D4", "text": "Add filters for Branch, Salesperson, Model, Status and Payment Mode that combine with the date filters (AND logic) rather than replacing them."}]}, {"key": "dash2", "title": "Phase 3b — Dashboard Page 2: Analytics", "tasks": [{"id": "D11", "text": "Add an accessories panel: share of customers who showed interest vs who actually bought accessories vs who came back post-delivery, and the total revenue (and implied profit, at a margin % you define and state) each stage represents."}, {"id": "D9", "text": "Add a discount panel: total and average discount given, trended by month, split by Scheme Applied."}, {"id": "D12", "text": "Add a finance panel: Payment Mode split, and for financed deals, a breakdown of Finance Bank usage — both as a table and as a chart."}, {"id": "D10", "text": "Add a panel showing what share of billed/closed deals used each Scheme Applied value, ranked."}, {"id": "D8", "text": "Add a panel on Safety Rating: what share of Closed deals